Error: Jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker: Cannot take a write window through `View<U8>` — it has read access only
  --> Tests/UI/view_subrange_read_only_write.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     window: bytes[0..<1].in_place()
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `View<T>` may inspect its owner's elements, but it cannot change them
 Fix: Take the write window from a `ViewMut<T>` or from the mutable owner instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker
